# SHACL sh:inversePath property path.
# Source: https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/#property-paths
# ex:Bob ex:parentOf ex:Alice, so an inverse-path lookup from ex:Alice along
# ex:parentOf finds ex:Bob. ex:Carol has no such incoming edge.
PREFIX ex: <http://example.com/ns#>

ex:Alice a ex:Person .
ex:Bob a ex:Person ; ex:parentOf ex:Alice .
ex:Carol a ex:Person .
